        <qualifiedname>themis::gpu::GPUMetrics::rocm_profiler_export</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Export kernel records in ROCm profiler Chrome trace JSON format. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Produces a Chrome trace JSON document compatible with AMD ROCm profiler&apos;s <computeroutput>--sys-trace</computeroutput> output and with Perfetto / chrome://tracing. Each kernel is emitted as a complete event (<computeroutput>"ph": "X"</computeroutput>) so that tooling built around the ROCm profiler JSON schema can consume the output without modification.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="return"><para>UTF-8 JSON string. When no kernels have been recorded the <computeroutput>"traceEvents"</computeroutput> array is present but empty. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
